@startuml
!include ../../../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/structural/component-diagram-style.iuml

title Layer Types by Abstraction Level\nFrom concrete foundation to abstract presentation

rectangle "**Presentation Layer**\n//Most abstract - Most volatile//\nUI Components | View Models | Presentation Logic" as PRES $fill_primary

rectangle "**Application Layer**\n//Use-case coordination//\nUse Cases | Workflows | App Services" as APP $fill_ok

rectangle "**Domain Layer**\n//Business logic and rules//\nBusiness Rules | Domain Entities | Domain Services" as DOM $fill_caution

rectangle "**Infrastructure Layer**\n//Technical services//\nPersistence | Messaging | Security" as INFRA $fill_alt

rectangle "**Foundation Layer**\n//Most concrete - Most stable//\nUtilities | Platform Abstraction | Data Structures" as FOUND $fill_invalid

PRES -[$line_primary]-> APP
APP -[$line_primary]-> DOM
DOM -[$line_primary]-> INFRA
INFRA -[$line_primary]-> FOUND

note right of PRES
  **Volatile:** Changes
  with user needs and
  UI technology
end note

note right of FOUND
  **Stable:** Rarely
  changes; reusable
  across applications
end note
@enduml
